    hasSFX: 0
    soundEffect: {fileID: 0}
    _line: So, Ben, what do you wanna do? Got any party games or anything?
    _speakerProperties:
    - _speakerType: 1
      _name: 
      _profile: {fileID: 11400000, guid: cef2e72371f654a43b43317c22347f40, type: 2}
    _characterSpriteSettings:
    - _spriteIndex: 0
      IsSubject:
        _isEnabled: 1
        _value: 1
      IsRevealed:
        _isEnabled: 1
        _value: 1
      HasArrived:
        _isEnabled: 1
        _value: 1
      StartingAnchorPosition:
        _isEnabled: 0
        _value: {x: 0, y: 0}
      StartingDimensions:
        _isEnabled: 1
        _value: {x: 750, y: 900}
      ImageSearchParameters:
        _isEnabled: 1
        _value:
          _profile: {fileID: 11400000, guid: cef2e72371f654a43b43317c22347f40, type: 2}
          _imageType: 0
          _version: 1
  - _newBackground:
      _isEnabled: 0
      _value: {fileID: 21300000, guid: f4ec4e5eca95145dabda9d7966da008b, type: 3}
    hasBackground: 0
    background: {fileID: 21300000, guid: f4ec4e5eca95145dabda9d7966da008b, type: 3}
    hasSFX: 1
    soundEffect: {fileID: 8300000, guid: f45c87f50355e3a4e933dfae013f360b, type: 3}
    _line: Well, no, not really. I kinda just wanted to see you, I dunno. Based on
      how eager you were to come along, maybe you're feeling the same?
    _speakerProperties:
    - _speakerType: 2
      _name: 
      _profile: {fileID: 11400000, guid: cef2e72371f654a43b43317c22347f40, type: 2}
    _characterSpriteSettings:
    - _spriteIndex: 0
      IsSubject:
        _isEnabled: 1
        _value: 1
      IsRevealed:
        _isEnabled: 1
        _value: 1
      HasArrived:
        _isEnabled: 1
        _value: 1
      StartingAnchorPosition:
        _isEnabled: 0
        _value: {x: 0, y: 0}
      StartingDimensions:
        _isEnabled: 1
        _value: {x: 750, y: 900}
      ImageSearchParameters:
        _isEnabled: 1
        _value:
          _profile: {fileID: 11400000, guid: cef2e72371f654a43b43317c22347f40, type: 2}
          _imageType: 4
          _version: 1
  - _newBackground:
      _isEnabled: 0
      _value: {fileID: 21300000, guid: f4ec4e5eca95145dabda9d7966da008b, type: 3}
    hasBackground: 0
    background: {fileID: 21300000, guid: f4ec4e5eca95145dabda9d7966da008b, type: 3}
    hasSFX: 0
    soundEffect: {fileID: 0}
    _line: '(No. Way. Is he... saying what I think he''s saying?)

'
    _speakerProperties:
    - _speakerType: 1
      _name: 
      _profile: {fileID: 11400000, guid: cef2e72371f654a43b43317c22347f40, type: 2}
