  - _newBackground:
      _isEnabled: 0
      _value: {fileID: 21300000, guid: f4ec4e5eca95145dabda9d7966da008b, type: 3}
    hasBackground: 0
    background: {fileID: 21300000, guid: f4ec4e5eca95145dabda9d7966da008b, type: 3}
    hasSFX: 0
    soundEffect: {fileID: 0}
    _line: Ah. Uhh... you wanna maybe take this outside, then? The stars are pretty
      this time of night.
    _speakerProperties:
    - _speakerType: 1
      _name: 
      _profile: {fileID: 11400000, guid: cef2e72371f654a43b43317c22347f40, type: 2}
    _characterSpriteSettings:
    - _spriteIndex: 0
      IsSubject:
        _isEnabled: 1
        _value: 1
      IsRevealed:
        _isEnabled: 1
        _value: 1
      HasArrived:
        _isEnabled: 1
        _value: 1
      StartingAnchorPosition:
        _isEnabled: 0
        _value: {x: 0, y: 0}
      StartingDimensions:
        _isEnabled: 1
        _value: {x: 750, y: 900}
      ImageSearchParameters:
        _isEnabled: 1
        _value:
          _profile: {fileID: 11400000, guid: cef2e72371f654a43b43317c22347f40, type: 2}
          _imageType: 4
          _version: 1
  - _newBackground:
      _isEnabled: 0
      _value: {fileID: 21300000, guid: f4ec4e5eca95145dabda9d7966da008b, type: 3}
    hasBackground: 0
    background: {fileID: 21300000, guid: f4ec4e5eca95145dabda9d7966da008b, type: 3}
    hasSFX: 1
    soundEffect: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 7ab41a35e21fc7846a577c574f8693cb, type: 3}
    _line: Ooh, that's a good idea, yeah! Here, the backyard's this way. That's where
      that pool I mentioned earlier is, too.
    _speakerProperties:
    - _speakerType: 2
      _name: 
      _profile: {fileID: 11400000, guid: cef2e72371f654a43b43317c22347f40, type: 2}
    _characterSpriteSettings:
    - _spriteIndex: 0
      IsSubject:
        _isEnabled: 1
        _value: 1
      IsRevealed:
        _isEnabled: 1
        _value: 1
      HasArrived:
        _isEnabled: 1
        _value: 1
      StartingAnchorPosition:
        _isEnabled: 0
        _value: {x: 0, y: 0}
      StartingDimensions:
        _isEnabled: 1
        _value: {x: 750, y: 900}
      ImageSearchParameters:
        _isEnabled: 1
        _value:
          _profile: {fileID: 11400000, guid: cef2e72371f654a43b43317c22347f40, type: 2}
          _imageType: 1
          _version: 1
  - _newBackground:
      _isEnabled: 0
      _value: {fileID: 21300000, guid: f4ec4e5eca95145dabda9d7966da008b, type: 3}
    hasBackground: 1
    background: {fileID: 7198068466479746110, guid: 8978da17e2ba548938c5827a2855bbf5, type: 3}
    hasSFX: 0
    soundEffect: {fileID: 0}
    _line: You follow Ben to the backyard. He seems a little tense as he leads you
      to the edge of the pool.
    _speakerProperties:
    - _speakerType: 0
      _name: 
      _profile: {fileID: 11400000, guid: cef2e72371f654a43b43317c22347f40, type: 2}
    _characterSpriteSettings:
    - _spriteIndex: 0
      IsSubject:
        _isEnabled: 1
        _value: 0
      IsRevealed:
        _isEnabled: 1
        _value: 0
      HasArrived:
        _isEnabled: 1
        _value: 0
      StartingAnchorPosition:
        _isEnabled: 0
        _value: {x: 0, y: 0}
      StartingDimensions:
        _isEnabled: 1
        _value: {x: 750, y: 900}
      ImageSearchParameters:
        _isEnabled: 1
        _value:
          _profile: {fileID: 11400000, guid: cef2e72371f654a43b43317c22347f40, type: 2}
          _imageType: 1
          _version: 1
  - _newBackground:
      _isEnabled: 0
      _value: {fileID: 21300000, guid: f4ec4e5eca95145dabda9d7966da008b, type: 3}
    hasBackground: 0
    background: {fileID: 7198068466479746110, guid: 8978da17e2ba548938c5827a2855bbf5, type: 3}
    hasSFX: 1
    soundEffect: {fileID: 8300000, guid: b949ebd089be19a4e8da79030c7a5172, type: 3}
    _line: Ah, don't mind me, I'm just gonna dip my feet in the water. I know it's
      a cool night out, but I just love the feeling of the water.
    _speakerProperties:
    - _speakerType: 2
      _name: 
      _profile: {fileID: 11400000, guid: cef2e72371f654a43b43317c22347f40, type: 2}
    _characterSpriteSettings:
    - _spriteIndex: 0
      IsSubject:
        _isEnabled: 1
        _value: 1
      IsRevealed:
        _isEnabled: 1
        _value: 1
      HasArrived:
        _isEnabled: 1
        _value: 1
      StartingAnchorPosition:
        _isEnabled: 0
        _value: {x: 0, y: 0}
      StartingDimensions:
        _isEnabled: 1
        _value: {x: 750, y: 900}
      ImageSearchParameters:
        _isEnabled: 1
        _value:
          _profile: {fileID: 11400000, guid: cef2e72371f654a43b43317c22347f40, type: 2}
          _imageType: 1
          _version: 1
  - _newBackground:
      _isEnabled: 0
      _value: {fileID: 21300000, guid: f4ec4e5eca95145dabda9d7966da008b, type: 3}
    hasBackground: 0
    background: {fileID: 7198068466479746110, guid: 8978da17e2ba548938c5827a2855bbf5, type: 3}
    hasSFX: 1
    soundEffect: {fileID: 8300000, guid: f45c87f50355e3a4e933dfae013f360b, type: 3}
    _line: You know, for as long as I can remember, I've liked the ocean, actually.
    _speakerProperties:
    - _speakerType: 2
      _name: 
      _profile: {fileID: 11400000, guid: cef2e72371f654a43b43317c22347f40, type: 2}
    _characterSpriteSettings:
    - _spriteIndex: 0
      IsSubject:
        _isEnabled: 1
        _value: 1
      IsRevealed:
        _isEnabled: 1
        _value: 1
      HasArrived:
        _isEnabled: 1
        _value: 1
      StartingAnchorPosition:
        _isEnabled: 0
        _value: {x: 0, y: 0}
      StartingDimensions:
        _isEnabled: 1
        _value: {x: 750, y: 900}
      ImageSearchParameters:
        _isEnabled: 1
        _value:
          _profile: {fileID: 11400000, guid: cef2e72371f654a43b43317c22347f40, type: 2}
          _imageType: 0
          _version: 1
  - _newBackground:
      _isEnabled: 0
      _value: {fileID: 21300000, guid: f4ec4e5eca95145dabda9d7966da008b, type: 3}
    hasBackground: 0
    background: {fileID: 7198068466479746110, guid: 8978da17e2ba548938c5827a2855bbf5, type: 3}
    hasSFX: 1
    soundEffect: {fileID: 8300000, guid: f45c87f50355e3a4e933dfae013f360b, type: 3}
    _line: I can't really pinpoint why. It's just... I dunno, it's so fascinating
      to me to think about all the different forms of life we've never even seen,
      just because they're underwater.
    _speakerProperties:
    - _speakerType: 2
      _name: 
      _profile: {fileID: 11400000, guid: cef2e72371f654a43b43317c22347f40, type: 2}
    _characterSpriteSettings:
    - _spriteIndex: 0
      IsSubject:
        _isEnabled: 1
        _value: 1
      IsRevealed:
        _isEnabled: 1
        _value: 1
      HasArrived:
        _isEnabled: 1
        _value: 1
      StartingAnchorPosition:
        _isEnabled: 0
        _value: {x: 0, y: 0}
      StartingDimensions:
        _isEnabled: 1
        _value: {x: 750, y: 900}
      ImageSearchParameters:
        _isEnabled: 1
        _value:
          _profile: {fileID: 11400000, guid: cef2e72371f654a43b43317c22347f40, type: 2}
          _imageType: 0
          _version: 1
  - _newBackground:
      _isEnabled: 0
      _value: {fileID: 21300000, guid: f4ec4e5eca95145dabda9d7966da008b, type: 3}
    hasBackground: 0
    background: {fileID: 7198068466479746110, guid: 8978da17e2ba548938c5827a2855bbf5, type: 3}
    hasSFX: 1
    soundEffect: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 7ab41a35e21fc7846a577c574f8693cb, type: 3}
    _line: We talked about freshwater and saltwater fish the other day, right? I
      really think I want to become a diver and study marine biology.
    _speakerProperties:
    - _speakerType: 2
      _name: 
      _profile: {fileID: 11400000, guid: cef2e72371f654a43b43317c22347f40, type: 2}
    _characterSpriteSettings:
    - _spriteIndex: 0
      IsSubject:
        _isEnabled: 1
        _value: 1
      IsRevealed:
        _isEnabled: 1
        _value: 1
      HasArrived:
        _isEnabled: 1
        _value: 1
      StartingAnchorPosition:
        _isEnabled: 0
        _value: {x: 0, y: 0}
      StartingDimensions:
        _isEnabled: 1
        _value: {x: 750, y: 900}
      ImageSearchParameters:
        _isEnabled: 1
        _value:
          _profile: {fileID: 11400000, guid: cef2e72371f654a43b43317c22347f40, type: 2}
          _imageType: 1
          _version: 1
  - _newBackground:
      _isEnabled: 0
      _value: {fileID: 21300000, guid: f4ec4e5eca95145dabda9d7966da008b, type: 3}
    hasBackground: 0
    background: {fileID: 7198068466479746110, guid: 8978da17e2ba548938c5827a2855bbf5, type: 3}
    hasSFX: 1
    soundEffect: {fileID: 8300000, guid: b949ebd089be19a4e8da79030c7a5172, type: 3}
    _line: Honestly, no one's ever given me the time of day when I've brought this
      stuff up. I've got friends, sure, but I don't honestly feel much of a connection
      to them.
    _speakerProperties:
    - _speakerType: 2
      _name: 
      _profile: {fileID: 11400000, guid: cef2e72371f654a43b43317c22347f40, type: 2}
    _characterSpriteSettings:
    - _spriteIndex: 0
      IsSubject:
        _isEnabled: 1
        _value: 1
