    _line: But you? I'm still not really sure if you're just placating me or if you're
      really interested in what I've got to say, but you're actually listening to
      what I have to say.
    _speakerProperties:
    - _speakerType: 2
      _name: 
      _profile: {fileID: 11400000, guid: cef2e72371f654a43b43317c22347f40, type: 2}
